WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.750
Step 1: At the kiosk, enter your staff PIN: the last four digits of your saved phone number, including any leading zeroes.

2
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:14.250
Step 2: Open the feature you need. The app uses your account’s permissions and the device’s assigned location.

3
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:20.250
Step 3: Use the left navigation rail, expanded search and blue account dropdown to move around.

4
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:26.250
Step 4: Choose Lock kiosk when finished. The kiosk also locks after two minutes without interaction.
